      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    weights = [0.40, 0.35, 0.25]\n    variances = [0.0225, 0.0156, 0.0304]\n    correlations = [\n        [1.0, 0.8, 0.4],\n        [0.8, 1.0, 0.6],\n        [0.4, 0.6, 1.0]\n    ]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    portfolio_variance = 0.0\n    for i in range(len(weights)):\n        for j in range(len(weights)):\n            portfolio_variance += (\n                weights[i]\n                * weights[j]\n                * correlations[i][j]\n                * (variances[i] ** 0.5)\n                * (variances[j] ** 0.5)\n            )\n\n    portfolio_standard_deviation = portfolio_variance ** 0.5\n    answer = round(portfolio_standard_deviation, 4)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
